costroid runs a coding agent under a budget and records what it cost.

Usage:
  costroid run --budget-usd N -- <agent command>
  costroid report --rows rows.jsonl
  costroid demo
  costroid validate [costroid.yml]
  costroid lint [--strict] [paths]
  costroid help <command>
  costroid --version

The agent command is claude -p or codex exec. Costroid adds the flags it needs.

Other commands: ingest-run, init, doctor, follow-up, approve, reconcile, export,
connect, review, policy, lint-recipes, version, result, mcp, emit-otlp.
Ledger commands: gateway, serve, keys, egress.
